[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

66
00:09:07,303 --> 00:09:13,735
[Slow] 100歳以上の人は、全国で何人いますか。

67
00:09:14,535 --> 00:09:20,775
[Host] About one hundred seven thousand seven hundred — over one hundred thousand for the first time.

68
00:09:21,375 --> 00:09:29,320
[Slow] 100歳以上の人のうち、女性は全体の何パーセントですか。

69
